# host/crew.js  ->  skills/team-lane/SKILL.md
#     Nothing loads at session start. The skill description is the entry point, and the limits this file holds are written into the skill as text.
# host/crew-preset.js  ->  NOTHING — no line of code comes across, and no file here holds it.
#     NEW at v0.13.0. It declares the Crew preset for dsh 0.2.x (the `preset-crew` row of
#     cordis.patch.yml) and picks which dsh generation reads a preset. Claude Code has no
#     presets and no bundle patch — a role's tool filter is its own frontmatter, and design
#     rule 6 forbids a manifest, a preset or a patch here. The line is pinned anyway, because
